{"time": 1768656940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307820789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "1894年，马萨诸塞州，一个多雨的冬天。作为经济体寡头史密斯集团的继承人之一的梅·史密斯接收到了来自乔治·布罗德斯基博士的电报。你曾与他有过些许交情。此人是密斯卡托尼克大学的民族学客座教授。电报内容如下"}
{"time": 1768656949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264122726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=AD2403A8987FA1E061A67C5B6E3CA242.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRxcHq58Ha1hzrqF56Wo5lHJBEYpxiq6QQg_woovPqZydiSkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQU3ErhRbjtRgQPqTEch6wnXoCST2CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMJOzcMcS3WVhVirKvvASyIYbtMxezMc-24N5v2Q3nWp-eqr3Gfhq_r6fi-LJf5b35w,file_size=79018]"}
{"time": 1768657086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901569606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "作为接班人的[CQ:at,qq=979090618] 认识一些“道上的朋友”。比如据说是灵媒的[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 和手底下有些能干的保镖的某黑帮头头"}
