{"time": 1768659758, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1064915619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[梅史密斯]进行技能[聆听:29]检定: 1D100=34/29 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1768659860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058941205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "戴着兜帽不怎么显眼，不过倒是很清晰就能认出这次的委托人，去找她\"您好?\""}
{"time": 1768659876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511326808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "听得见的只有自然的夜曲，昏暗的建筑时而隐约显现，时而消失在夜色中"}
{"time": 1768660074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837843728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“你好，徐玖莉小姐。既然我们都到了，就启程吧。”我微笑道"}
{"time": 1768660161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1281843815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我慢慢从随身的皮包中掏出早已准备好的地图，弯下身子，与二人一同查看起来"}
{"time": 1768660188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709689061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#凑过去看"}
{"time": 1768660251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538544784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "凑过去看看"}
{"time": 1768660321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071062699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "看地图的间隙，抬头用我深邃美丽的眼眸观察车站的附近是否有车辆服务，或者有什么看上去像是服务人员的人。"}
{"time": 1768660372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927369288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这河湾小镇规模不大，镇上有着几十户人家，没有路灯，路也说不上好走。交通运输大概主要靠马车和河边的码头。直接走过去的话，大概一小时内也能抵达。不过早冬的雨夜也不是那么讨人喜欢"}
{"time": 1768660524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128250563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "不想在冷雨中步行，提议找一辆提供服务的厢式马车，坐马车前往山庄。"}
{"time": 1768660554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520462317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有兜帽的关系倒是不怎么担心小雨"}
{"time": 1768660570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248309543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "车站上只有你们几人，灯泡的亮光也不是很稳定，不知道什么时候会熄灭"}
{"time": 1768660670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868864855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1128250563]“这里太冷清，这个时间没有太多马车师傅。”"}
{"time": 1768660682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81415212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“亲爱的合作者们，冷雨夜令人想归家，赞美壁炉。我们还是乘马车区去落日山庄吧。”我搜寻马车的踪影"}
{"time": 1768660684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869351186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#出站看看有没有等着接客的马车"}
{"time": 1768660779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21256361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也没有，想来没人愿意在这守着几天一班、几班才能见到一个人的车站，当然🐴也不愿意"}
{"time": 1768660820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478720100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过想来委托人不会计较推迟今晚到明早的12小时"}
{"time": 1768660874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070647005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“实在是太令人遗憾了。”我摇了摇头，撑起随身携带的雨伞，“我建议快些前往山庄，这个小镇看上去没有为外来者准备的暂泊之处。”"}
{"time": 1768660949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160060986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我呼了一口气，将手中的行李箱抬了抬，“希望山庄有壁炉。我的药剂不能受潮。”"}
{"time": 1768661021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065318369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#脱下西装外套“可以用衣服包住”"}
{"time": 1768661123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706187524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我向面前这位有色人种投出略带惊讶的目光，“谢谢，您的好意我心领了，我们快些上路就好。”"}
{"time": 1768661201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270150996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#并不在意打在身上的冻雨，往庄园放方向前进"}
{"time": 1768661245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017198810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在最后面，\"唉，希望会有有趣的事情吧。\""}
{"time": 1768661314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974543280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "盘旋的灰色雾气将地标晕染成梦幻般的模糊轮廓。空气异常潮湿黏腻，还弥漫着一丝淡淡的、令人不适的腐臭味。你们在坑洼泥泞的碎石路上艰难前行，终于看到\n一扇透出光亮的窗户。"}
{"time": 1768661351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60323985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然还不是庄园。不过看起来戴维斯埠现在还有人醒着"}
{"time": 1768661379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948564102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我十分好奇，用我高挑的身材轻轻探头望去，看看是否能发现什么"}
{"time": 1768661382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457620844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“……”"}
{"time": 1768661415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008801347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#埋着头走，没有注意到梅的眺望"}
{"time": 1768661458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994403103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来大概是这小镇上唯一还亮着灯的屋子了"}
{"time": 1768661473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985893477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "。ra 侦察"}
{"time": 1768661473, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1985893477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[梅史密斯]进行技能[侦察:50]检定: 1D100=75/50 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1768661495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306929429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "（那好吧）"}
{"time": 1768661514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584561471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低着头走，倒也没怎么注意到其他人的动作"}
{"time": 1768661640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283286971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我轻轻碰了一下身边的须玖莉，“那个屋子，是一路上唯一亮着灯的诶，要不要试着看下有没有有趣的事情。”"}
{"time": 1768661702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98310785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#回头，也看着那间屋子"}
{"time": 1768661729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710968940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“好的”"}
