{"time": 1768661818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878151686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我兴致勃勃地看着这位有色人种的行为，让我联想起我父亲为我讲的南方童话"}
{"time": 1768661829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710875719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2028124176]（那是你没有看到冷静的我）"}
