{"time": 1768661874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546034188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "（我是正宗南方佬，1894年没有特别地种族歧视已经是进步了）"}
{"time": 1768661926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47797983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（怎么说？没人拦我真踢门去了）"}
