{"time": 1768662261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999816537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=71494346]（我的意思是，你随便打发一下走了）"}
