{"time": 1768662303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216560026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（谁知道有乐子人雇主（）"}
{"time": 1768662312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919502135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "”哦，我亲爱的大块头先生，你最好把枪收起来。“我挑着眉毛说道，”现在已经不是西部牛仔的时代了，而且牛仔一般没有晒这么黑的。“"}
{"time": 1768662334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498941303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "”他们会带宽沿的遮阳帽，你最好也买一顶。“"}
{"time": 1768662363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494887306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=498941303]”Understand“"}
{"time": 1768662369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358112591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#收起手枪"}
{"time": 1768662382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744457123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦哦，我知道你的意思了，应该戴着白色的头套吧？\""}
{"time": 1768662397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "398528216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "踹门声响起时，狗吠声也随之开始——先是一只，接着是两只、四只，最后变成六个围绕着你们转的、低矮而不善的音源，在夜色之中视线几乎追不上它们的身体，只有反着绿光的眼睛格外渗人。"}
{"time": 1768662421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086455287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，一般来说如果没打算把屋子里的人全突突了）"}
{"time": 1768662434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499189361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不会踹门的，自有城堡法在此）"}
{"time": 1768662472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041799229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（虽然不太懂城堡法，但是枪法还是懂点（）"}
{"time": 1768662550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687773867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#用脚驱赶守门犬"}
{"time": 1768662589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601514781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "”哦，糟糕，房主养的小可爱可不好惹。”我走到门前，试图与房内的人交流。“阁下您好，刚刚有个teenager踢你的门，被我等一行人赶走了，现在已经不会有人打扰您了，可否让这些可爱的狗狗回家，放我们继续赶路呢。”"}
{"time": 1768662615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092737372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧...\"眯着眼看着这些家伙\"是不是狗也应该戴着头套?\""}
{"time": 1768662673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022334279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是其实狗就在门前啊）"}
{"time": 1768662730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144396847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "（我声音够大，里面的人能听见，有回复吗）"}
{"time": 1768662963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226455215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "四周响起越来越多低沉的咆哮。你越是驱赶，就越围绕着你转，根本不怕你，更有甚者已经咬上摩西的裤脚。不过屋子里点起了另一盏灯，看起来总归是有人的。门后有人打亮了手电筒，不过暂未开门“外面搞什么？狗子们——雷弗、蓝鼻子、捕手，滚回窝里去！”"}
{"time": 1768663029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351678772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那些原本看似凶狠不退的狗，突然夹着尾巴溜进夜色中消失了。几声挑衅般的吠叫后，四周重归寂静。"}
{"time": 1768663048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010453769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#站着，等待指示"}
{"time": 1768663135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436148985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“看来这个小镇还是有绅士的存在的。”我轻轻将摩西拽回来自己绅士而优雅地踱步到门前，“先生您好，我已见识您的气度，请问您知道落日山庄该怎么走吗？”"}
{"time": 1768663210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91791083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "闭上嘴，耸耸肩，\"有趣的事情这么快就结束了啊。\"依然戴着兜帽"}
{"time": 1768663275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392000563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没看出来有趣在哪（））"}
{"time": 1768663295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877561788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "（六只哈吉汪，多可爱）"}
{"time": 1768663436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061457851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "或许是出于礼貌，门内的人打开了门，戴着有些滑稽的绒球睡帽“我叫克劳德·拉伦。落日山庄倒是不远。你们，来这儿找人的？这么晚了，要不要进来歇歇”"}
{"time": 1768663486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787053664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?这件事就看史密斯先生的意见咯\"在先生上着重咬字"}
{"time": 1768663607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079844463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“正是如此，那我们就恭敬不如从命了。”我微笑道，率先收起伞拿着行李箱走进屋子，同时示意二人一同进屋。“我们确实是应邀来此地找人的，维克托-戴维斯和菲利普戴维斯的名字，您应该听过吧。”"}
{"time": 1768663634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963802035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "进屋的同时，默默打量一下这个房子，以及里面的陈设，有什么值得注意的地方。"}
{"time": 1768663637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299224279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "。ra 侦察"}
{"time": 1768663637, "type": "reply", "message_id": "299224279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[梅史密斯]进行技能[侦察:50]检定: 1D100=6/50 极难成功，流水落花春去也，天上人间"}
{"time": 1768663682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830296733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#跟着进屋"}
{"time": 1768663734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301023654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着进屋，四处打量一番"}
{"time": 1768663896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579987752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "屋内还有个妇人，身穿居家服，手持提灯，礼貌地朝你们微笑着。屋内燃着壁炉，温暖干燥。\n|“戴维斯一家，当然。落日庄园的主人。”克劳德点点头“算见过几面”"}
{"time": 1768664045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883181346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“我的上帝，幸好有壁炉。”我惊喜地微笑道，“拉伦先生，拉伦夫人，请容我迟到的自我介绍，我是梅史密斯。”我向他们行礼致意。"}
{"time": 1768664060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083626657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "（我侦察到这个屋子有什么特别之处了吗）"}
{"time": 1768664080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678049433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没什么特别之处）"}
{"time": 1768664093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327772532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大概轮不到自己来自我介绍，不开口"}
{"time": 1768664137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885159712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "（哦吼，那看来目前没活）"}
{"time": 1768664157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881388077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（起码是本地人）"}
{"time": 1768664176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852278977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（非说有的话）"}
{"time": 1768664241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919275947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“关于这个小镇，还有落日山庄，有什么值得我们注意的地方吗？比如风土人情，特色美食与景点之类的。”我在离壁炉最近的位置坐下，“请二位不吝赐教。”"}
{"time": 1768664342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032875840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1579987752]你注意到他说这句话的时候表情有些微妙，像是在看旁观别人看一部自己看过的恐怖电影，而马上就要到jump scare的桥段"}
{"time": 1768664531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910981413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我注意到拉伦先生脸上的不自然，静静地等待他回复我的话"}
{"time": 1768664700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646718229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1919275947]“一座普普通通的小村子而已，没有肥美的牛羊，只有河里的一条大鳄鱼比尔”他摇摇头“落日庄园是这附近第二大的庄园，最大的那个在黑支流上游，不过已经荒废很久了。”"}
{"time": 1768664905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553905552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看在你们远道而来的份上，提醒你们一下。戴维斯一家有些，怎么说呢，不总是好客的”"}
{"time": 1768664949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311300544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“您的小毛球们，倒也是很可爱。”我优雅地微笑道，“看来您和夫人是本地人，对此地非常了解。我有一个疑问，为什么来的一路上，其他人家都熄灯掩门，了无生气。”"}
{"time": 1768665020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672087114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“多谢提醒，可以再详细告诫我们一下吗？”我身体前倾，左手托腮，一副饶有兴致的模样，“您或者其他镇民，有过作为他们客人的不愉快经历吗？”"}
{"time": 1768665048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349335727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=311300544]他指了指墙上的挂钟“毕竟现在都八点了，这儿又不是什么大城市”"}
{"time": 1768665215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920735850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今晚承蒙收留。\"微微低头"}
{"time": 1768665278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213531003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=672087114]他轻咳了咳“背地里议论人总是不太好。他也算我们半个客户。不用太担心，只是些态度上的事”"}
{"time": 1768665489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816597095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“哦？”我的兴致更加浓厚，“有客户，那就有生意。恰好我的父亲也是一名生意人，请问阁下是做哪方面的生意呢？”我的身子更加前倾，眉毛挑动着。"}
{"time": 1768665532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529729355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“也许我可以成为你的另一半客户。”"}
{"time": 1768665618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609726412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有时找我们买些野味。他们订购的东西送到码头或者车站，有时候让我们运送”他有些兴趣“你们做什么生意的？”"}
{"time": 1768665711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427997356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "似乎和自己没什么关系的样子，干脆不再参与话题，到一边坐着。"}
{"time": 1768665979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340539989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "“我父亲的生意？可能什么都涉及一些，把东西送到需要的人手中之类的。”我眼睛转了一圈，回忆我那位父亲的事迹。“野味？都有什么，我可以尝尝吗？”"}
{"time": 1768666152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366444509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“兔子，鹿，野猪。这边山里东西还挺多的。”他转身对女主人说道“夏妮丝，把炖菜再热热吧”"}
{"time": 1768666208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441878581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我觉得问的话够多了，打算接受他们的盛情款待，先饱餐一顿再决定是否今晚前往山庄。"}
{"time": 1768666229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716041875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其他人呢）"}
{"time": 1768666306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821781338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（不太能说话）"}
{"time": 1768666310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682355190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(又插不上话)"}
{"time": 1768666318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371517947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "”那就恭敬不如从命，家庭风味的炖菜无论何时都是那么让人无法抗拒，在这异乡的冷夜有幸认识您二位，真是感谢上帝。“"}
{"time": 1768666326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210577999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "我看向二人，询问他们要不要一起吃"}
{"time": 1768666378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618146841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你知道的，其实这里本来没那么多内容.jpg）"}
{"time": 1768666384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970382592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头"}
{"time": 1768666403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627506501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#拿起食物开吃"}
{"time": 1768666604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184881192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "用料无非是大蒜洋葱，土豆萝卜。大概还加了些奶油。烹饪手法也没什么特别的，不过肉料扎实，在冬夜里来上一碗是不可多得的享受"}
{"time": 1768666633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143234922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "吃完饭，想起门外的小狗们，询问自己是否可以买一只带回家。”单看外表，它们像是一个妈妈的孩子，但从生育能力上来讲，许多动物都比人类伟大的多。“我拿着勺子，再舀起一勺炖菜送入口中，”如果可以的话，我能带走一只吗？“"}
{"time": 1768666701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991216359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "看下时间以及外面的天气情况，思考是否要继续前往山庄"}
{"time": 1768666727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539057487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "吃完饭怎么也九点了。雨势没有变小的意思，反倒越下越大"}
{"time": 1768666785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502728917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看向拿主意的人"}
{"time": 1768666786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655317400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "979090618"}, "sender": {"id": "979090618", "name": "无名"}, "message": "（能过个心理学，看看房子的主人有没有想留客人住下的愿望吗）"}
{"time": 1768666839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482150485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "979367137", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=143234922]“也不都是我养的。不过你想买的话，可以十美元卖你一只”"}
